# 6. PRIVATE KEYS

Ищи абсолютно все разновидности:

```text
-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----
-----BEGIN EC PRIVATE KEY-----
-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----
-----BEGIN DSA PRIVATE KEY-----
-----BEGIN ENCRYPTED PRIVATE KEY-----
```

Также:

* SSH keys;
* signing keys;
* JWT signing keys;
* encryption keys;
* TLS private keys;
* certificate private keys.

Проверь `.pem`, `.key`, `.crt`, `.p12`, `.pfx`, `.jks`.

